$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-mnl
<a class="mgdb-skip-link" href="#mnl-main">Skip to main content</a>

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-mnl-page" id="mnl-main">

  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/sitemap">Community</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><span aria-current="page">Maize Newsletter</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="mgdb-hero-basic" aria-labelledby="mnl-title">
    <span class="mgdb-hero-basic-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 84 84" role="presentation" focusable="false">
        <path d="M42 22c-7-5-16-7-25-7v48c9 0 18 2 25 7 7-5 16-7 25-7V15c-9 0-18 2-25 7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <line x1="42" y1="22" x2="42" y2="70" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" />
        <line x1="24" y1="32" x2="34" y2="32" stroke="#d99a0b" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="24" y1="43" x2="34" y2="43" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="50" y1="32" x2="60" y2="32" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="50" y1="43" x2="60" y2="43" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h1 id="mnl-title">Maize Genetics Cooperation Newsletter</h1>
      <p>Published annually from $(first-year) to $(last-year) and fully electronic from volume $(electronic-from) onward. A compendium of notes and information on working research, shared throughout the maize research community.</p>
      <p class="mnl-status"><span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-info">No longer published</span> All $(volume-count) volumes remain online and citable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this page">
    <a href="#mnl-archive" class="is-current">Archive</a>
    <a href="#mnl-about">About the newsletter</a>
    <a href="#mnl-history">History</a>
    <a href="#mnl-related">Related resources</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="mnl-archive" aria-labelledby="mnl-archive-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="mnl-archive-title">Archive</h2></div>
      <p>$(volume-count) volumes across $(decade-count) decades. $(pdf-count) have a whole-volume PDF; every volume opens on mnl.maizegdb.org.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mnl-finder">
      <form id="mnl-form" class="mgdb-search" role="search">
        <div class="mgdb-search-row">
          <div class="mgdb-field">
            <label class="mgdb-label" for="mnl-query">Search volumes</label>
            <p class="mgdb-hint" id="mnl-query-hint">Match a volume number or a year. Example: <code>89</code>, <code>1975</code>, or <code>1930s</code></p>
            <input class="mgdb-input" id="mnl-query" name="q" type="search" aria-describedby="mnl-query-hint" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <div class="mgdb-field mnl-decade-field">
            <label class="mgdb-label" for="mnl-decade">Decade</label>
            <select class="mgdb-select" id="mnl-decade">
              <option value="">All decades</option>
              $(decade-options)
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mnl-controls">
          <div class="mnl-view-switch" role="group" aria-label="Archive view">
            <button class="mnl-view-btn" type="button" data-view="grid" aria-pressed="true">Grid</button>
            <button class="mnl-view-btn" type="button" data-view="list" aria-pressed="false">List</button>
          </div>
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" id="mnl-reset" type="button" hidden>Clear</button>
          <span class="mgdb-result-count" id="mnl-count" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="mnl-view" id="mnl-view-grid" data-view-panel="grid">
      <ul class="mnl-grid" id="mnl-grid">$(volume-cards)</ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mnl-view" id="mnl-view-list" data-view-panel="list" hidden>
      <div class="mgdb-table-scroll">
        <table class="mgdb-table" id="mnl-table">
          <caption>Every volume of the Maize Genetics Cooperation Newsletter<span class="mgdb-muted">Volume, publication date, the whole-volume PDF where one exists, and where the volume is hosted. Volumes $(electronic-from) and later were published electronically, as separate per-article PDFs.</span></caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Volume</th>
              <th scope="col">Published</th>
              <th scope="col">Whole volume</th>
              <th scope="col">Format</th>
              <th scope="col">Address</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>$(volume-rows)</tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-empty" id="mnl-empty" hidden>
      <h3>No volumes match those filters</h3>
      <p>Try a volume number or a four-digit year, or widen the decade back to all.</p>
      <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" id="mnl-empty-reset" type="button">Clear search and filters</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mnl-about" aria-labelledby="mnl-about-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="mnl-about-title">About the newsletter</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-prose-layout">
      <div class="mgdb-prose">
        <p>The Maize Genetics Cooperation Newsletter has been published annually since $(first-year), and became fully electronic with volume $(electronic-from), 2015. It is a compendium of notes and information on working research intended to be shared throughout the maize research community.</p>
        <p>Articles submitted to the newsletter may not be used as references without the consent of the author.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="mgdb-aside-card">
        <h3>Citing a volume</h3>
        <p>Each volume keeps the address it was published under. Both <code>mnl.maizegdb.org/94</code> and the older <code>mnl.maizegdb.org/mnl/60/</code> form are live, so existing citations continue to resolve.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mnl-history" aria-labelledby="mnl-history-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="mnl-history-title">History</h2></div>
      <p>Published accounts of how the newsletter began at Cornell in 1929.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-stack">
      <article class="reference-result-card">
        <div class="reference-result-meta"><span>2019</span><span>Book</span></div>
        <h3><a href="https\://ecommons.cornell.edu/handle/1813/66550" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Founding of the Maize Genetics Cooperation News Letter at Cornell University: A 90th Anniversary Tribute</a></h3>
        <p class="reference-result-authors">Kass, L.B., E.H. Coe, M.N. Cook, M.E. Smith, J.L. Singer &#40;Eds.&#41; 2019. Foreword by E.S. Buckler.</p>
        <p class="reference-result-citation">Internet-First University Press &middot; Ithaca, New York</p>
        <div class="reference-result-links">
          <a href="https\://ecommons.cornell.edu/handle/1813/66550" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cornell eCommons &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reference-result-card">
        <div class="reference-result-meta"><span>2005</span><span>Article</span><span>PubMed</span></div>
        <h3><a href="http\://www.genetics.org/content/169/4/1787.long" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cornfests, cornfabs and cooperation: the origins and beginnings of the maize genetics cooperation news letter</a></h3>
        <p class="reference-result-authors">Lee B. Kass, Christophe Bonneuil, Edward H. Coe Jr.</p>
        <p class="reference-result-citation">Genetics &middot; 169 &middot; 1787&ndash;1797</p>
        <div class="reference-result-links">
          <a href="http\://www.genetics.org/content/169/4/1787.long" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full text &nearr;</a>
          <a href="http\://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/?term=15879515" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PubMed &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reference-result-card">
        <div class="reference-result-meta"><span>2019</span><span>Seminar</span></div>
        <h3><a href="https\://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tKrRBfwlyEY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Celebration of the 90th anniversary of the founding of the Maize Genetics Cooperation News Letter at Cornell University</a></h3>
        <p class="reference-result-authors">Presented by Dr. Lee B. Kass on April 23, 2019.</p>
        <div class="reference-result-links">
          <a href="https\://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tKrRBfwlyEY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mnl-related" aria-labelledby="mnl-related-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="mnl-related-title">Related resources</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel">
      <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
        <a href="/maize_history">
          <strong>Maize history</strong>
          <span>A century of maize genetics</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/reference">
          <strong>Reference search</strong>
          <span>The curated maize literature</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/maize_history#history-classic-reads">
          <strong>Classic papers</strong>
          <span>Influential maize genetics</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.maizegenetics.org">
          <strong>Maize Genetics Cooperation</strong>
          <span>The organization behind it</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/whatsnew">
          <strong>News archive</strong>
          <span>MaizeGDB announcements</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
)
